{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04447","headline":"同王员外雨後登开元寺南楼因酬晖上人独坐山亭有赠 · 陈子昂","name":"同王员外雨後登开元寺南楼因酬晖上人独坐山亭有赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"钟梵经行罢，香林坐入禅。\n岩庭交杂树，石濑泻鸣泉。\n水月心方寂，云霞思独玄。\n宁知人世里，疲病得攀缘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04447.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04447","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}